## Third-party assets

The following files were downloaded from
`https://github.com/niccolomiranda/chiara-luzzana` via
`cdn.jsdelivr.net` and self-hosted under this repository:

- `assets/sound/mainSound.mp3`
- `assets/sound/rollovers/rol05.mp3`
- `assets/sphere/matCap0.jpg`
- `assets/sphere/slice2.fbx`

The original upstream license for these files has not been
verified. If the operator does not have the right to redistribute
them, this commit can be reverted; the original external URLs are
recoverable from the git history of the `@improve` advisor commits
prior to commit `c99420a`. Replace with owned assets before any
public deployment to a domain other than the original.
